{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ecd984bd1bfbb8ab9286114669484e5e02d57cb2067410efc2971cecc3239867", "ja": "はぁ……終わっちゃったなぁ……。", "zh": "唉……结束了啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1001_p", "source_sha256": "46f4efa6f38b6592fd19c0b6d5017e272866cab21c33a36ed9656635bb5c0cf4", "ja": "お疲れ様、雪歩。\nずいぶん疲れてるみたいだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，雪步。\n看起来你挺累的，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ba3e89fb971be4a4c45221ecf916e0e1caa6bd07751459c550da6e516cb82e9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　すみません、\nぼんやりしてて……今すぐ着替えてきますぅ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！对不起，我刚才有点发呆……这就去换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0d073853ddcc37038ea55f51c30261ed5e328d33ae8948df536eee6bce2543bc", "ja": "そんなに急がなくても大丈夫だよ。\n疲れてるのかなって心配になっただけだから。", "zh": "不用这么着急，没关系的。\n只是有点担心你是不是累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8fb76c7c59540c08028c498cb428f56e3dcf4084ceccd7a77c131a3e92e60b5f", "ja": "うぅ、心配おかけしてすみません……。ちょっとだけ、\nライブの余韻にひたっちゃってたみたいです……。", "zh": "呜呜，让您担心了，对不起……我好像只是\n稍微沉浸在演出的余韵里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c77c23287a62b8a606398a033c2484c1517451ffb0de35e7283e65b30690f63a", "ja": "ステージから見えた景色が、すごく綺麗で……\n終わっちゃうのが、なんだかもったいないなぁって。", "zh": "从舞台上看到的景色特别美……  \n总觉得就这样结束了，好像有点可惜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0e26f3e4347ddc9d23538576894e6afd5e2feb1d39db3eb4a0f46b092be504ca", "ja": "そうだな。一面に満開の桜が広がっている\nライブ会場なんて、なかなかないもんな。", "zh": "是啊。满眼都是盛开的樱花，\n这样的演唱会场地可不多见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "92387e484e3eb1fdc79da1957d97165eb24b64719ce3ed6d4cd60f9795e0599e", "ja": "はい。ステージにも客席にも、\nたくさんの花びらが舞って、幻想的で……。", "zh": "是的。舞台上和观众席中，\n都飘舞着许多花瓣，真是如梦似幻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2290987c4589270b907787b6ed7e5f282970a72a3d52b1e48abf335afa8f245a", "ja": "{$P$}も、見てくれましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}也看到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "368866b41fe51164159e512851c672d3bf48cd82034a17746300600608ac8357", "ja": "ああ、ここからちゃんと見てたよ。けどその様子だと、\n今日はあんまり緊張しなかったみたいだな。", "zh": "嗯，我一直在这里认真看着呢。不过看你这个样子，\n今天好像没怎么紧张嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "60ec72496ae8c858467796d0ac1679828fe9b47f1006775965f24d56ede52356", "ja": "い、いえ。お客さんの顔がよく見えるので、\n最初は、すごく緊張してました……。", "zh": "不、不是的。因为能清楚看到客人的脸，刚开始的时候特别紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4e577d1bceebb24e6e085e3eb95e51815a2efea5f8ba33ec3e0c6bb48accbd89", "ja": "でも今日は、いつものライブとはすこし違って……\nお花見特有の雰囲気、っていうんでしょうか？", "zh": "不过今天和往常的演出有点不一样……\n该说是赏花特有的氛围吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d109395b71e0f67b69cedf81f04e6324e32107565764f3fa061f0ef4c1c4552d", "ja": "お客さんも、和やかな表情なのがわかって……\n気がついたら、緊張もほぐれてました。", "zh": "我发现客人们的表情也都很和蔼……回过神来，紧张感也缓解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cecb3a656d08913a47fb925f25a782234cb146fcfd5e6770f39457317abbe1eb", "ja": "そうか。\nお花見ライブ、雪歩にはあってたみたいだな。", "zh": "这样啊。赏樱直播看来很适合雪步呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d53e3b8e6060383f1cd3edfe2efd01eed2bc2ea33accf3cf6efc8d8bcefd05ec", "ja": "そ、そうかもしれません……。ライブの前にも、\nみんなと屋台を回ったりしましたし……。", "zh": "是、是有可能……在演唱会开始前，我还和大家一起逛了逛摊位……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0f4ceaba2bb2a8d69ba1cc3a6242d6adf5cc5b03c030ed072407a75021226f39", "ja": "お仕事だってことを忘れそうになるくらい、\nお花見を満喫できた気がします……えへへ。", "zh": "感觉都快忘了这是在工作，尽情享受了一番赏樱……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a42725f9b1b040436177dea88a0ef737b031073befbb25d7b61a1c1aeaa3a63a", "ja": "今回は「みんなでお花見を楽しむ」ってコンセプト\nだったからな。雪歩も楽しめたなら何よりだよ！", "zh": "因为这次的理念就是“大家一起享受赏花”嘛。雪步也能玩得开心，那就再好不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1017_p", "source_sha256": "64ab8a29232bdce03ea56d4e8f172b16885fdf6ff1676d818ea09da3a1bfbbfe", "ja": "俺も時間があればと思ったけど、結局バタバタして、\nゆっくり屋台巡りとまではいかなかったな。", "zh": "我本来也想要是有时间就好了，但最后一直忙忙碌碌的，没能悠闲地逛遍摊位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "10fe02efaf991e0106339876c97e919a8354b62e95019fbf301b338f47888363", "ja": "はうっ！　す、すみません、{$P$}！\n私ばっかり楽しんじゃって……！", "zh": "呀！对、对不起，{$P$}！\n光顾着我自己开心了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d026f3da290e9fe983d16aac1d810cefdc21c37b50f3a9afe00b2ea6d64f0729", "ja": "え？　いや、気にしなくていいよ。\n時間ができたら寄ろうぐらいの気持ちだったし……。", "zh": "诶？没事，不用在意。\n我本来就是想着有时间的话顺便去一趟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ff5661746a4a7c1be14d859f1fb70abfc80043b7e69bfa24bcb598c6286e2244", "ja": "いえ！　こんな、気遣いもできないなんて……\nやっぱり私はダメダメですぅ……！", "zh": "不！连这种体贴都做不到……\n我果然太没用了呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f756aa0dc7e18fb2f9dba916cfb1053a185c5f00607d806dedf4d6c822598254", "ja": "わ、私、{$P$}の代わりに屋台で\nお買い物してきますね！　待っててくださいっ！", "zh": "我、我去替{$P$}去摊位上\n买东西回来！请您等等我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0313_1022_p", "source_sha256": "500270d5c9ead9a1f5e5c042929a525db0112d9b0b151ba57723d0d469e24619", "ja": "え！？　でも雪歩、まだ着替えて……\n待ってくれ、雪歩ー！！", "zh": "诶！？可是雪步，你还没换好衣服……等等，雪步——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
